      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mightyschoop\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> mightyschoop:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have 6 in the Uprising box, the promo bonus card, and 8 poison cards.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This is correct. &nbsp;7 main Power Cards (1 is a promo card) and 8 Poison cards (2 copies of each). &nbsp;The Poison cards are used in conjunction with her powers and placed on other heroes (like Plague Rat's Infection cards from SotM)</p>",
