      "created_at": "2014-08-14T19:50:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ha, it's not impossible.&nbsp; But it'd take a long boring weekend for me even to take a shot at it, and it won't be like with SotM - we don't get official rulings anymore like we used to because the stable of knowledgeable playtesters we have now answer questions before Christopher ever can.&nbsp; So it'd have to be full of \"probably correct\" information rather than \"officially confirmed\" information.&nbsp; That's probably still worth doing, though.</p>",
