      "raw": "<p>Ha, it&#39;s not impossible.&nbsp; But it&#39;d take a long boring weekend for me even to take a shot at it, and it won&#39;t be like with SotM - we don&#39;t get official rulings anymore like we used to because the stable of knowledgeable playtesters we have now answer questions before Christopher ever can.&nbsp; So it&#39;d have to be full of &quot;probably correct&quot; information rather than &quot;officially confirmed&quot; information.&nbsp; That&#39;s probably still worth doing, though.</p>",
