      "raw": "[quote=\"McBehrer\"]\n\nThey are also not removed from play when The Operative or the player next to them are incapacitated. They can only be removed by their own text.\n\n[/quote]\n\nDuring playtesting, it was confirmed that the poisons stay when Operative is incapped but not when the player that&#39;s poisoned is incapped.\n\n[quote=\"lutherbellhendricksv\"]\n\nWhen someone is incapacitated, you basically wipe their board. Powers, tokens, everything. The poisons too.\n\n[/quote]\n\n",
