      "created_at": "2014-08-15T00:27:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was under the impression that Christopher had said otherwise. \"They are the Operative's cards, not theirs, so they are not removed.\"</p><p>It may depend on who was asked first, as it may have changed.</p>",
