    {
      "id": 114259,
      "name": "Katsue",
      "username": "Katsue",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-17T18:42:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Koga\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/48/2058_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Koga:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>During playtesting, it was confirmed that the poisons stay when Operative is incapped but not when the player that's poisoned is incapped.</p>\n<div><b>lutherbellhendricksv wrote:</b><br><blockquote>When someone is incapacitated, you basically wipe their board. Powers, tokens, everything. The poisons too.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>For the next printing of the expansion, I feel that this should be put on the Poison cards, as it is not obvious which way it should work.</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:07.005Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 10936,
      "topic_slug": "the-operative",
      "display_username": "Katsue",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Koga\"]\n\nDuring playtesting, it was confirmed that the poisons stay when Operative is incapped but not when the player that&#39;s poisoned is incapped.\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>lutherbellhendricksv wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">When someone is incapacitated, you basically wipe their board. Powers, tokens, everything. The poisons too.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n\n[/quote]\n\nFor the next printing of the expansion, I feel that this should be put on the Poison cards, as it is not obvious which way it should work.\n",
