      "id": 114260,
      "name": "Greywind",
      "username": "Greywind",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/{size}/2006_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-18T01:09:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ha, it's not impossible.&nbsp; But it'd take a long boring weekend for me even to take a shot at it, and it won't be like with SotM - we don't get official rulings anymore like we used to because the stable of knowledgeable playtesters we have now answer questions before Christopher ever can.&nbsp; So it'd have to be full of \"probably correct\" information rather than \"officially confirmed\" information.&nbsp; That's probably still worth doing, though.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>At the very least, the file could be written up and Christopher could go over it making any corrections necessary. That's a lot less time on him than him writing it up himself.</p>",
